# escape_gate_donn -- the sea-door to Tech Duinn, the House of Donn, where the dead gather. Spoken to in the hall, and
# again on the landing past it (escape_donn).

@file underworld/escape
@encounter 4

= the sea-door
@continue
No door fills the frame. Only the opening, and the cold coming in over the worn sill in folds.
% [Gaeilge le teacht]
Mourners are carved either side, I think. The stone about them is slick with damp.
% [Gaeilge le teacht]
A smell comes up from below: water that never felt daylight.
% [Gaeilge le teacht]

= where it goes
This is the way to Teach Duinn. No green shore beyond:
% [Gaeilge le teacht]
only the rock, and the house upon it, and Donn waiting within.
% [Gaeilge le teacht]
Come to my house, all of you, after your death. The words of Donn.
% [Gaeilge le teacht]
